## 🔌 API Documentation

**Base URL**: `http://localhost:8083/api/v1`

### Order Management
| Endpoint | Method | Description | Request Body | Headers |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `/ingest-orders` | `POST` | Seeds sample order data | None | N/A |
| `/orders/bulk` | `POST` | Bulk ingests orders | `List<OrderEntity>` | `application/json` |

### AI Ticket Agent
| Endpoint | Method | Description | Request Body | Headers |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `/agent/triage` | `POST` | Classifies ticket category & priority | `TicketRequestDto` | `application/json` |
| `/agent/ingest-policies` | `POST` | Ingests Markdown policies into vector store | None | N/A |
| `/agent/evaluate-ticket` | `POST` | Evaluates a ticket using AI | `TicketRequestDto` | `X-Conversation-Id`, `application/json` |
| `/agent/pending-approvals` | `GET` | Lists all tickets awaiting human review | None | N/A |
| `/agent/pending-approvals/user` | `GET` | Lists pending tickets for a specific user | None | `X-Conversation-Id` |
| `/agent/tickets/{ticketId}/human-review` | `POST` | Submits a human decision | `HumanReviewRequestDto` | `application/json` |
| `/agent/evaluate/run` | `GET` | Runs evaluation report against `.jsonl` cases | `filePath` (query param) | N/A |

### Request Schemas
- **`TicketRequestDto`**: `{ "ticketId": "TKT-123", "issueDescription": "..." }`
- **`HumanReviewRequestDto`**: `{ "approved": true, "overrideDecision": "...", "reviewerNotes": "...", "idempotencyKey": "unique-id" }`
- **`TriageResultDto`**: `{ "category": "refund", "priority": "high", "escalationNeeded": true }`

