## 🧪 Testing the APIs

A complete test suite is provided to verify the end-to-end flow.

1. **Navigate to the scripts directory**:
   ```bash
   cd scripts
   ```
2. **Run the test orchestrator**:
   ```bash
   ./test-all-apis.sh
   ```
This script will sequentially seed data, ingest policies, evaluate a sample ticket, and submit a human review.

